@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1/signalements
@clientToken = <client-jwt>
@adminToken = <admin-jwt>

### Signalement - Create signalement (CLIENT)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

{
  "contratId": 1,
  "contenu": "Le contrat contient une erreur sur le montant."
}

### Signalement - List client signalements
GET {{baseUrl}}/client?page=0&size=10&statut=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Signalement - List all signalements (ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin?page=0&size=20&statut=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Signalement - Update signalement statut (ADMIN)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "statut": "RESOLVED",
  "reponseAdmin": "Problème traité, merci."
}

### Signalement - Mark signalement as read (ADMIN)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
